NOTE ON SCOPE

This license covers only the original work in this repository: the tools in
tools/, the RomRaider definition in definitions/, and the documentation in
docs/ and README.md.

It does NOT cover:

  - rom/*.bin — Subaru/Fuji Heavy Industries firmware, included for
    interoperability and repair research. All rights remain with its owner.

  - decompiled/*.c — machine-generated output derived from those binaries,
    carrying the same status.

  - docs/shift-curves-reference.png — a chart produced by a member of the
    RomRaider forum community, reproduced for reference. Not my work and not
    mine to license.

The ROM images were dumped and shared by members of the RomRaider forum thread
"5EAT TCM JECS ROM Image". They are included for interoperability and repair
research. No ownership is claimed over any of them.
